# Ghostty's GTK window on Dolly's X server, with Slop in it: the Xsdl server
# takes the display, and Ghostty draws its terminal with Mesa's OpenGL
# (softpipe through EGL, OpenGL 4.3 as Ghostty asks) and its window's
# widgets with cairo. GTK's text is fontconfig's, from the terminal's font.
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-core 7205c35aed897514d3094f14a194669f73c295b4dd0213619d90155da8467cde
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-posix a98de8b50ce0a29e867194e9fe9c44a54c0ea48ccf25a0f1353431daf827cf9e
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-display 2032dbc473505507c7419267f43fdb2fe76b16b0907ca27f2b157a0ec54bda35
INSTALL /v0.1.5/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 3bf185540204059ae4b94f6ccbc21c73ae3044f1c5be3663708980c7539b4133
INSTALL /v0.1.5/demos/ghostty-gtk/Dollyfile-ghostty-gtk 72b78f6eeb34922f7aab6cb4eb62aee1b4caccf9eb35725c6e0cfba55f6e73d5
